.TH tkuhexedit n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkuhexedit \- small Tcl/Tk hex viewer/editor widget
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkuhexedit
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkuhexedit::widget .hex]
.br
::tkutils::tkuhexedit::loadFile $w file.bin
.SH DESCRIPTION
The tkutils::tkuhexedit package creates a compact Tk widget for viewing and
lightly editing binary data. It shows offset, hexadecimal bytes and printable
ASCII text.
.SH COMMANDS
widget, loadFile, saveFile, setData, getData, gotoOffset, findText, findHex,
patchHex, render.
.SH LIMITS
The editor keeps data in memory and patchHex is length-preserving. It does not
insert or delete bytes.
.SH SEE ALSO
tclutils::tubin, tclutils::tuhexedit, tclutils::tuhexdump
